    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "choice is between a small cost to the organizer and an unfair gap"
  },
  {
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "have the organizer thank her directly too",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "she'd want to hear appreciation from the organizer",
