  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "Anything less would be arbitrary",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I think she'd be glad of it",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "I'd want her to have that"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "No and smaller both create a gap with no upside for anyone",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "coworker expects to be treated as my equal here",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "keeps things even"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "coworker would feel respected by an equal payment",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "helping her feel that matters more to me than a few saved dollars",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "I'd ask the organizer to find a way anyway"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "If I recommended less, I'd be putting a crack in something that works",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "she trusts me to speak up for her",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "she did exactly what I did and should get the same"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "that case rests on nothing except saving money",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "guess she'd want her effort recognized as clearly as mine",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "I'd also mention to her afterward that I backed her"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I figure she'd feel appreciated",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "I'd want the organizer to make that happen",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "alternative saves $200 and leaves someone shortchanged"
  },
  {
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "ask the organizer to give it to her the same way",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "she'd rather it feel like genuine thanks than a correction",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "trade-off is the organizer's cost",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "Fairness tips it"
  }
